      "text": "$CCI is up 9% today because $SPCX could be the next next big wireless carrier. \n\n$SPCX reportedly wants at least 80,000 U.S. cell sites which is about every U.S. tower $CCI and $AMT own combined.\n\nTowers are already built so adding a new tenant is almost pure profit on long contracts with yearly price bumps. Interesting to see how seriously the market is taking $SPCX's entry into telecom.",
